%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: EvilEntityconclusion
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103185826971653
    - rid: 7856103185826971654
    - rid: 7856103185826971655
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0afee15b7c0b2ad4481946e7b9820870, type: 2}
    dialog: Hello again.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103185826971656
    - rid: 7856103185826971657
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: Yes, yes, I've returned.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0afee15b7c0b2ad4481946e7b9820870, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh... you're here, too.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: Anyway, how would I go about adding a...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: Whitelist to the interface.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0afee15b7c0b2ad4481946e7b9820870, type: 2}
    dialog: A... whitelist?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: Yes, a list of entities, or objects, that are allowed access to certain...
      priveleges or functions.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0afee15b7c0b2ad4481946e7b9820870, type: 2}
    dialog: Ah, there's already a function for the opposite of that.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: You added a blacklist function to the interface? Why?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: I thought the point was that it could interact with any sentient being...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0afee15b7c0b2ad4481946e7b9820870, type: 2}
    dialog: If you'd believe it, it's because I thought that beings should be free
      to opt-out of the... experience.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm beginning to think I made a mistake working with you.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0afee15b7c0b2ad4481946e7b9820870, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103185826971710
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0afee15b7c0b2ad4481946e7b9820870, type: 2}
    dialog: Anyway, what are you planning on doing with your "whitelist?"
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103185826971711
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: You've seen what {mc}'s been up to-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: That boy's newfound apathy toward life is hardly conducive to the narrative
      I'm attempting to weave.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0afee15b7c0b2ad4481946e7b9820870, type: 2}
    dialog: Just wipe his mind, then. Simple solution.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: You know why that wouldn't work-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: The girls already know too, and for some reason {Player} has been cooperating
      with them!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0afee15b7c0b2ad4481946e7b9820870, type: 2}
    dialog: Is that the name of the higher entity you made the interface for?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: That's what they go by.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm... surprised Natsuki was even able to ask what their name was...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: When porting everything over I made sure that "input name" prompt was
      a one-and-done deal for the title scene-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0afee15b7c0b2ad4481946e7b9820870, type: 2}
    dialog: Like you said, they're from outside of the Dream, too.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0afee15b7c0b2ad4481946e7b9820870, type: 2}
    dialog: They have incredible influence on this world, even if they don't know
      it.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah, but this world has a completely different ruleset from-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: You know what, nevermind.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: Haaahh...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0afee15b7c0b2ad4481946e7b9820870, type: 2}
    dialog: Since you're here, I've got a question for you.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: Yes, what is it?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0afee15b7c0b2ad4481946e7b9820870, type: 2}
    dialog: What have you been doing at Solstheim?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, you've seen what I've been up to over there?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: 'Well, to explain what I''ve been doing over there, I sort of have to
      go over the why:'
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: It's because I have the distinct displeasure of having to work with this
      land.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0afee15b7c0b2ad4481946e7b9820870, type: 2}
    dialog: That's a bit harsh, no?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: 'Don''t get me wrong, there''s a reason I decided to send them here to
      weave my tale:'
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: This firmament has quite the broad range of useful facets, characters,
      and environments to work with.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: The problem being is that the people who orchestrated this land were
      under the impression that outside observers would favor the world over all
      else.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: Even to the detriment and/or exclusion of an interesting narrative.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: 'So, as a storyteller myself, I have to work with the mediocre pieces
      that are already '
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0afee15b7c0b2ad4481946e7b9820870, type: 2}
    dialog: And what exactly is so "mediocre...?"
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: The absolute refusal to dig any deeper than the surface elements at play.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: It's remarkable how much potential is there, in spite of how little of
      it is actually realized.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: 'The central conflict, for example: the first dragonborn meets the last,
      and what comes of it?'
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: The first dragonborn dies and the last, allegedly, takes their place
      as a pawn of ol' Herma Mora.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: 'The conflict is wholly impersonal: the player must defeat Miirak because
      he''s evil and trying to take over the world.'
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: Miirak must defeat the player because they're getting in the way.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: There really isn't anything interesting to gain from that, nor is there
      very much around it to supplement it.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: Hermaeus Mora is both the lynch pin for the player's success, and the
      whole reason this conflict started in the first place.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: But the story is unwilling to acknowledge that! The real antagonist gets
      to walk away scot-free, potentially claiming the player character as a pawn.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: So, yeah, that island requires serious revisioning that demands my presence.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0afee15b7c0b2ad4481946e7b9820870, type: 2}
    dialog: So much so that you're going to ignore what your, I hesitate to call
      them, "characters" are up to?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: I've briefly glanced at what they've been up to. For all intents and
      purposes they've just been treading water.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: The elves have been doing a good job at keeping them distracted from...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: Whatever it is that they think they're trying to accomplish.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103185826971712
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: How did Monika put it again, looking into "smart people-"
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: Wait.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7856103185826971713
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: What are you even doing here-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: How did you even-?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: Why would you-!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: You know what? Whatever.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: Get the hell out of here!
    ScreenActions: []
